Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Predict N6-Methyladenosine (m6A) RNA Modification Sites
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("BIO215", "Student", email = "bio215.student@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A random forest framework for predicting N6-methyladenosine
    (m6A) RNA modification sites from transcript and sequence features. The
    package bundles a model trained on 48055 human m6A sites and provides
    single-site and batch prediction functions with documented examples and
    tests.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    randomForest,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    ggplot2,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    scales,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
